{"title":"샤를","artist":"벌룬","sourceId":"reference:7O3p0pXuop36UOsYY3C7","sourceHash":"ae80d2a0b2b1c005d3e9c3ebd4eee642933d600a3210e31803b56d3405805c3d","performanceStatus":"reference_timing","timingMethod":"reference_lrc_unverified","reviewStatus":"draft","cue_timing_confirmed":false,"timingWarning":"(주의) 노래와 함께 타이밍 검증되지 않았음","cues":[{"id":"1","start":1.04,"end":4.03,"text":"さよならはあなたから言った","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"2","start":4.03,"end":7.03,"text":"それなのに頬を濡らしてしまうの","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"3","start":8.54,"end":11.28,"text":"そうやって昨日の事も消してしまうなら","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"4","start":11.28,"end":14.16,"text":"もういいよ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"5","start":14.16,"end":17.16,"text":"笑って","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"6","start":27.89,"end":30.78,"text":"花束を抱えて歩いた","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"7","start":30.78,"end":33.78,"text":"意味もなくただ街を見下ろした","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"8","start":35.03,"end":37.46,"text":"こうやって理想の縁に心を置き去っていく","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"9","start":37.46,"end":40.41,"text":"もういいか","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"10","start":40.41,"end":42.87,"text":"空っぽでいよう","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"11","start":42.87,"end":45.87,"text":"それでいつか深い青で満たしたのなら","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"12","start":47.59,"end":49.62,"text":"どうだろう","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"13","start":49.62,"end":52.62,"text":"こんな風に悩めるのかな","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"14","start":53.97,"end":56.97,"text":"愛を謳って謳って雲の上","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"15","start":58.2,"end":61.2,"text":"濁りきっては見えないや","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"16","start":62.05,"end":64.75,"text":"嫌嫌","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"17","start":64.75,"end":67.75,"text":"遠く描いていた日々を","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"18","start":67.96,"end":70.96,"text":"語って語って夜の群れ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"19","start":71.47,"end":74.47,"text":"いがみ合ってきりがないな","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"20","start":75.17,"end":78.05,"text":"否否","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"21","start":78.05,"end":81.05,"text":"笑い合ってさよなら","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"22","start":93.87,"end":96.87,"text":"朝焼けとあなたの溜息","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"23","start":96.88,"end":99.88,"text":"この街は僕等の夢を見てる","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"24","start":101.19,"end":103.74000000000001,"text":"今日だって互いの事を忘れていくんだね","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"25","start":103.74000000000001,"end":106.74000000000001,"text":"ねえ そうでしょ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"26","start":106.74000000000001,"end":109.18,"text":"黙っていよう","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"27","start":109.18,"end":112.18,"text":"それでいつか苛まれたとしても","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"28","start":113.67,"end":115.82,"text":"別に良いんだよ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"29","start":115.82,"end":118.82,"text":"こんな憂いも意味があるなら","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"30","start":120.18,"end":123.18,"text":"恋と飾って飾って 静かな方へ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"31","start":124.43,"end":127.43,"text":"汚れきった言葉を今","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"32","start":128.17,"end":131.11,"text":"今今","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"33","start":131.11,"end":132.98,"text":"「此処には誰もいない」","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"34","start":132.98,"end":134.04,"text":"「ええ、そうね」","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"35","start":134.04,"end":137.04,"text":"混ざって混ざって二人の果て","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"36","start":137.56,"end":140.56,"text":"譲り合って何もないな","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"37","start":141.56,"end":144.21,"text":"否否","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"38","start":144.21,"end":147.21,"text":"痛みだって教えて","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"39","start":149.1,"end":152.1,"text":"NaNaNaNa～","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"40","start":160.74,"end":163.42000000000002,"text":"きっときっとわかっていた","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"41","start":163.42000000000002,"end":166.42000000000002,"text":"騙し合うなんて馬鹿らしいよな","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"42","start":167.28,"end":169.82999999999998,"text":"ずっとずっと迷っていた","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"43","start":169.82999999999998,"end":170.63,"text":"ほらね","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"44","start":170.63,"end":173.63,"text":"僕等は変われない","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"45","start":173.85,"end":175.53,"text":"そうだろう","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"46","start":175.53,"end":178.53,"text":"互いのせいで今があるのに","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"47","start":179.59,"end":182.59,"text":"愛を謳って謳って雲の上","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"48","start":184.09,"end":187.09,"text":"濁りきっては見えないや","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"49","start":187.89,"end":190.46,"text":"嫌嫌","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"50","start":190.46,"end":193.46,"text":"日に日に増えていた後悔を","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"51","start":193.67,"end":196.67,"text":"語って語って夜の群れ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"52","start":197.13,"end":200.13,"text":"許し合って意味もないな","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"53","start":200.85,"end":203.85,"text":"否否","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"54","start":206.24,"end":209.24,"text":"愛を謳って謳って雲の上","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"55","start":213.22,"end":216.22,"text":"語って語って夜の群れ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"56","start":223.77,"end":226.77,"text":"笑い合ってさよなら","translation":"","kind":"lyric"}],"candidates":[]}